  "lastName": "Curtis",
  "overview": "Dr. Curtis is an Associate Professor of Medicine in the Division of Nephrology. She directs the medical student summer research program for the NIH/NIDDK-funded UAB-UCSD O’Brien Center for Acute Kidney Injury Research. She is also Associate Dean for Research and Training in the Graduate School, where she oversees the Office of Postdoctoral Education. She has graduate faculty status in the Department of Cell, Developmental and Integrative Biology at UAB. She has mentored  trainees at the undergraduate, graduate and postdoctoral levels many of whom have continued to pursue academic careers. Dr. Curtis has received mentoring awards including the Department of Medicine Excellence in Mentorship Award and the Graduate Dean's Award for Excellence in Mentorship.",
